# purpose: M4 at large size - a ring of six USD accounts passing money around while two EUR
#          accounts do the same, with freezes, closes and malformed lines interleaved.
# exercises: tags past t30; conservation of money per currency; frozen/closed on both ends.

OPEN c1 USD
OPEN c2 USD
OPEN c3 USD
OPEN c4 USD
OPEN c5 USD
OPEN c6 USD
OPEN d1 EUR
OPEN d2 EUR

DEPOSIT c1 600
DEPOSIT c2 500
DEPOSIT c3 400
DEPOSIT c4 300
DEPOSIT c5 200
DEPOSIT c6 100
DEPOSIT d1 50
DEPOSIT d2 50

# lap 1
TRANSFER c1 c2 0.75
TRANSFER c2 c3 120
TRANSFER c3 c4 5.5
TRANSFER c4 c5 99.99
TRANSFER c5 c6 0.01
TRANSFER c6 c1 300
TRANSFER d2 d1 5.5
BALANCE c2

# lap 2
TRANSFER c1 c3 120
TRANSFER c2 c4 5.5
TRANSFER c3 c5 99.99
TRANSFER c4 c6 0.01
TRANSFER c5 c1 300
TRANSFER c6 c2 42
TRANSFER d1 d2 300
FREEZE c3
TRANSFER c3 c4 1
TRANSFER c4 c3 1
TRANSFER c3 d1 1
BALANCE c3

# lap 3
TRANSFER c1 c4 5.5
TRANSFER c2 c5 99.99
TRANSFER c3 c6 0.01
TRANSFER c4 c1 300
TRANSFER c5 c2 42
TRANSFER c6 c3 11
TRANSFER d2 d1 0.75
transfer c1 c2 1
TRANSFER c1 c2
TRANSFER c1 c2 1.123
TRANSFER C1 c2 1
BALANCE c4

# lap 4
TRANSFER c1 c5 99.99
TRANSFER c2 c6 0.01
TRANSFER c3 c1 300
TRANSFER c4 c2 42
TRANSFER c5 c3 11
TRANSFER c6 c4 0.75
TRANSFER d1 d2 99.99
BALANCE c5

# lap 5
TRANSFER c1 c6 0.01
TRANSFER c2 c1 300
TRANSFER c3 c2 42
TRANSFER c4 c3 11
TRANSFER c5 c4 0.75
TRANSFER c6 c5 120
TRANSFER d2 d1 42
UNFREEZE c3
TRANSFER c6 c1 100000
TRANSFER c6 d2 1
TRANSFER d2 c6 1
BALANCE c6

# lap 6
TRANSFER c1 c1 300
TRANSFER c2 c2 42
TRANSFER c3 c3 11
TRANSFER c4 c4 0.75
TRANSFER c5 c5 120
TRANSFER c6 c6 5.5
TRANSFER d1 d2 120
BALANCE c1

# lap 7
TRANSFER c1 c2 42
TRANSFER c2 c3 11
TRANSFER c3 c4 0.75
TRANSFER c4 c5 120
TRANSFER c5 c6 5.5
TRANSFER c6 c1 99.99
TRANSFER d2 d1 0.01
WITHDRAW c6 100000
BALANCE c6
BALANCE c2

# lap 8
TRANSFER c1 c3 11
TRANSFER c2 c4 0.75
TRANSFER c3 c5 120
TRANSFER c4 c6 5.5
TRANSFER c5 c1 99.99
TRANSFER c6 c2 0.01
TRANSFER d1 d2 11
TRANSFER c6 c6 1
TRANSFER c6 zz 1
TRANSFER zz c6 1
TRANSFER zz zz 1
BALANCE c3

# lap 9
TRANSFER c1 c4 0.75
TRANSFER c2 c5 120
TRANSFER c3 c6 5.5
TRANSFER c4 c1 99.99
TRANSFER c5 c2 0.01
TRANSFER c6 c3 300
TRANSFER d2 d1 5.5
BALANCE c4

# lap 10
TRANSFER c1 c5 120
TRANSFER c2 c6 5.5
TRANSFER c3 c1 99.99
TRANSFER c4 c2 0.01
TRANSFER c5 c3 300
TRANSFER c6 c4 42
TRANSFER d1 d2 300
BALANCE c5

# c6 still holds money: a tiny transfer out, then CLOSE is refused, and transfers keep working
BALANCE c6
TRANSFER c6 c1 0.01
BALANCE c6
CLOSE c6
TRANSFER c6 c1 1
TRANSFER c1 c6 1

# final: USD must total 2100.00, EUR 100.00
BALANCE c1
BALANCE c2
BALANCE c3
BALANCE c4
BALANCE c5
BALANCE c6
BALANCE d1
BALANCE d2
